prompt_definitions.simple_json:
Read the visible invoice. Return only one JSON object with this simple shape:
{"invoice_id": string|null, "document_date": string|null, "supplier": string|null, "agreement_id": string|null, "equipment_id": string|null, "serial_number": string|null, "service_start": string|null, "service_end": string|null, "service_end_exclusive": boolean|null, "quantity": number|null, "rate": number|null, "line_amount": number|null, "net_amount": number|null, "currency": string|null, "not_visible": [string]}
Use null when the document does not show a value. Do not infer missing values or add source locations, citations, candidate IDs, hashes, confidence, or ambiguity flags. Preserve what the visible wording actually says, including whether the end date is exclusive.
